cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BluePort AI: waste classification for ports using computer vision (CLIP)"
abstract: "A privacy-first Telegram bot that classifies waste from photos using a frozen CLIP (ViT-B/32) encoder with a lightweight linear probe, reaching 94.6% cross-validated accuracy across six categories, served as a Hugging Face Space and as an offline Telegram bot."
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: MIT
